        {
          "text": "upper level",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/liberal-studies/table_b/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Please refer to the liberal studies chapter of this calendar for more information on the Liberal Studies Policy. Further information on liberal studies can also be found at the Faculty of Arts' Liberal Studies website (opens in new window) .",
